{0 curve448}

X448 key agreement and Ed448 / Ed448ph signatures for OCaml.

{1 API}

{!module:Curve448} is the public API. Link [curve448] for the pure OCaml
backend, or add [curve448.c] for the C backend. Initialise the random number
generator before generating keys. The [curve448.for_testing] library is
internal and is not a stable API.

{1 Guides}

See the {{:https://github.com/thevilledev/ocaml-curve448/tree/main/docs}documentation index}
for usage, backend selection, compatibility, design and testing. Markdown
guides are also installed in the package's documentation directory.

{1 Security}

This library has not received an independent cryptographic audit. Read the
{{:https://github.com/thevilledev/ocaml-curve448/blob/main/SECURITY.md}security policy}
for its audit status and side-channel limitations.
